[gd_scene load_steps=20 format=3]

; zone_ember_hollow — the first village and the woods around it (WLD-06; rebuilt for the map
; themes, 2026-09-23: village and woods with animals).
;
; A walled village that is safe ground, two gates, and six camps of animals ringed around it,
; with the old alpha's den in the north-west woods and a moss-grown shard in a grove to the
; north-east. The distances are not taste — ZoneRoot.Audit measures each camp against the leash
; of the creatures it produces, so the rat camps sit nearest and the wolf camps furthest.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id, and the woods are
; ScatterNodes: a ring, a count and the places to keep clear, seeded so the wood is the same on
; every load. Every creature is tuning in game/data/zones/act1.json. This file is coordinates.

